2. **Verdict per choice per benchmark** (VSI-Bench, ReVSI, VSTI): CLEAN (chosen on scenes disjoint from that benchmark, before its results were read), SELECTED ON BENCHMARK ITEMS (say which and how many candidates), or UNKNOWN (name the check).
